## SQ-GFB-02
@group A
@commands Done + 2 min: `tools/perf/eval/entity_census.py` on the world as in perf.md 12
@pass `minecraft:falling_block` near 0 (193 in the overall run); gravel item count lower than 21
@fails Falling blocks remain: check whether they come from a mod's own falling block class or the window was off
@reviewed 2026-11-16
# needs natural terrain (the overall run was a normal world): on superflat there is no sand or gravel to hold
bootexpect Done \(
> chunky center 0 0
> chunky radius 200
> chunky start
waitlog Task finished 1800
> cdevtest tickwarp 2400
waitlog verb=tickwarp end=done ticks=2400 180
> save-all flush
sleep 10
shell L=$(grep -m1 '^level-name=' server.properties | cut -d= -f2); python3 $INST/tools/perf/eval/entity_census.py "$L" | grep -iE "falling_block|gravel" | head -10
reject verb=\S+ .*done=0
look shell: minecraft:falling_block near 0 (193 in the overall run); gravel item count lower than 21
## SQ-GFB-03
@group A
@commands Find floating sand or gravel over a cave (or `/fill` sand over air in a freshly generated chunk with `/cdevplace`); break the block next to it, or place a block beside it
@pass The block falls on that update, as vanilla
@fails It never falls: the post-process flag stuck on (exception in postProcessGeneration?)
@reviewed 2026-11-16
> forceload add 300 300 310 310
> fill 300 -60 300 306 -50 306 minecraft:air
> cdevtest place 303 -55 303 minecraft:sand flags=18
> cdevtest tickwarp 40
waitlog verb=tickwarp end=done ticks=40 30
> cdevtest state 303 -55 303
> setblock 304 -55 303 minecraft:stone
> cdevtest tickwarp 60
waitlog verb=tickwarp end=done ticks=60 30
> cdevtest state 303 -55 303
> cdevtest state 303 -60 303
expect verb=state pos=303,-55,303 state=minecraft:sand
expect verb=state pos=303,-55,303 state=minecraft:air
expect verb=state pos=303,-60,303 state=minecraft:sand
reject verb=\S+ .*done=0
look the sand held over air without an update (flags 18), fell on the neighbour placement and landed at -60; generated floating sand in a real cave is the same check on a /cdevtest floating hit
