## SQ-STC-01
@group A
@commands `/cdevtest season minecraft:ocean,minecraft:desert,minecraft:snowy_plains,minecraft:plains` (tagged temperate, arid, frozen; plains untagged), `/reload` twice, the same again (the HUD and grass tint read the same cache)
@pass Season types unchanged after the reloads: `type=TEMPERATE` (ocean), `ARID` (desert), `FROZEN` (snowy plains), `null` (plains) in both reads, `enabled=true`
@fails A stale type after reload: the cache was not swapped
@reviewed 2026-11-16
> cdevtest season minecraft:ocean,minecraft:desert,minecraft:snowy_plains,minecraft:plains
> reload
sleep 20
> reload
sleep 20
> cdevtest season minecraft:ocean,minecraft:desert,minecraft:snowy_plains,minecraft:plains
count \[cdevtest\] verb=season biome=minecraft:ocean type=TEMPERATE enabled=true == 2
count \[cdevtest\] verb=season biome=minecraft:desert type=ARID enabled=true == 2
count \[cdevtest\] verb=season biome=minecraft:snowy_plains type=FROZEN enabled=true == 2
count \[cdevtest\] verb=season biome=minecraft:plains type=null == 2
count \[cdevtest\] verb=season done=1 == 2
reject \[cdevtest\] verb=season .*done=0
